      "text": "求欧拉方程 $x^2y'' + xy' - y = x^2$ 的通解。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "欧拉方程",
        "非齐次方程",
        "待定系数法"
      ],
      "question_type": "非齐次欧拉方程",
      "method": [
        "特征方程法",
        "待定系数法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "求齐次方程的通解",
        "用待定系数法求特解",
        "写出通解"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "euler_nonhomogeneous",
        "template": "$x^2y'' + xy' - y = x^2$（非齐次欧拉方程）",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 12,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "通解",
          "steps": [
            "齐次方程 $x^2y'' + xy' - y = 0$ 的特征方程：$m(m-1) + m - 1 = 0$",
            "$m^2 - 1 = 0$，根为 $m = \\pm 1$",
            "齐次通解：$y_h = C_1 x + C_2 x^{-1}$",
            "对于特解，尝试 $y_p = Ax^2$，则 $y_p' = 2Ax$，$y_p'' = 2A$",
            "代入：$x^2 \\cdot 2A + x \\cdot 2Ax - Ax^2 = x^2$",
            "$2Ax^2 + 2Ax^2 - Ax^2 = x^2$",
            "$3Ax^2 = x^2$，所以 $A = \\frac{1}{3}$",
            "特解：$y_p = \\frac{1}{3}x^2$",
            "通解：$y = C_1 x + C_2 x^{-1} + \\frac{1}{3}x^2$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kobe-2025-15b4e28a23-q04-practice-02",
