    {
      "text": "求微分方程 $(x^2-1)y'' - 2xy' + 2y = 0$ 的解（提示：$y_1 = x$ 是一个解）。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "降阶法",
        "特解",
        "二阶线性方程"
      ],
      "question_type": "已知特解的微分方程",
      "method": [
        "降阶法"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "利用已知特解进行降阶",
        "求得另一个线性无关解",
        "写出通解"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "reduction_of_order",
        "template": "$(x^2-1)y'' - 2xy' + 2y = 0$，已知 $y_1 = x$",
        "variable_count": 0
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "通解",
          "steps": [
            "设 $y = x \\cdot u(x)$，则 $y' = u + xu'$，$y'' = 2u' + xu''$",
            "代入方程：$(x^2-1)(2u' + xu'') - 2x(u + xu') + 2xu = 0$",
            "$(x^2-1)xu'' + [2(x^2-1) - 2x^2]u' = 0$",
            "$x(x^2-1)u'' - 2u' = 0$",
            "令 $v = u'$，则 $x(x^2-1)v' = 2v$",
            "$\\frac{dv}{v} = \\frac{2dx}{x(x^2-1)}$",
            "用部分分式：$\\frac{2}{x(x^2-1)} = -\\frac{2}{x} + \\frac{1}{x-1} + \\frac{1}{x+1}$",
            "$\\ln|v| = -2\\ln|x| + \\ln|x-1| + \\ln|x+1| + C$",
            "$v = \\frac{C(x^2-1)}{x^2}$",
            "$u = \\int \\frac{C(x^2-1)}{x^2}dx = C[x + \\frac{1}{x}]$",
            "另一解 $y_2 = x(x + \\frac{1}{x}) = x^2 + 1$",
            "通解：$y = C_1 x + C_2(x^2+1)$"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "kobe-2025-15b4e28a23-q04-practice-03",
      "school": "神户大学",
      "year": "2025"
    }
